  "details": "Hello everyone, today I have a suggestion for you. Many Thai and international friends have asked me for advice that VRChat should consider adding a customizable Chat Box system, where users can freely adjust the position (move up and down, height above the head). Many people have mentioned the issue that text can sometimes enter the character's head due to a avatar error related to height. This problem is especially common for users using VR headsets, who often have to look down for others to read their text. For players who have their sound off, this has been a problem for a long time. Please take this into consideration. This is a request from many community players that I have met vr and pc is same .",
